<view class="container upload-page">
  <view class="upload-head">
    <view class="page-title">上传发货单</view>
    <view class="muted">可以拍照、从相册选，或者直接上传聊天里的图片 / PDF。</view>
    <view class="mode-line">
      <view class="badge badge-{{modeTone}}">{{modeText}}</view>
      <view class="muted small">{{modeHint}}</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="source-grid">
    <view class="source-card camera-card" bindtap="chooseImages">
      <view class="source-icon">▣</view>
      <view class="source-title">拍照 / 相册</view>
      <view class="source-desc">适合纸质发货单</view>
    </view>
    <view class="source-card" bindtap="chooseFile">
      <view class="source-icon file-icon">≡</view>
      <view class="source-title">聊天文件 / PDF</view>
      <view class="source-desc">适合电子单据</view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="tips-card">
    <view class="tips-title">拍摄不用太讲究</view>
    <view class="tips-row"><text class="tips-dot"></text><text>横拍、轻微歪斜可以交给 AI 自动处理</text></view>
    <view class="tips-row"><text class="tips-dot"></text><text>一张发货单有多页时，一次全部选进来</text></view>
    <view class="tips-row"><text class="tips-dot"></text><text>AI 会先自己复核，实在看不清才让你处理</text></view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{files.length}}">
    <view class="section-head file-section-head">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title">已添加 {{files.length}} 个文件</view>
        <view class="muted small">这些文件会作为同一张发货单处理</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="file-list">
      <view wx:for="{{files}}" wx:key="id" class="file-row">
        <image
          wx:if="{{item.type === 'image'}}"
          class="thumb"
          src="{{item.path}}"
          mode="aspectFill"
          data-path="{{item.path}}"
          bindtap="previewImage"
        />
        <view wx:else class="pdf-thumb">PDF</view>
        <view class="file-info">
          <view class="file-name">{{item.name}}</view>
          <view class="file-meta">原文件会保留，可随时回看</view>
        </view>
        <view class="remove-button" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="removeFile">移除</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-note">
      <view class="privacy-title">识别后直接进入台账</view>
      <view class="muted small">没有“确认发货”步骤。只有 AI 无法确定的字段会单独标出来让你修改。</view>
    </view>

    <button
      class="primary-button recognize-button"
      loading="{{processing}}"
      disabled="{{processing}}"
      bindtap="startRecognition"
    >{{processing ? 'AI 正在整理…' : '开始识别并记录'}}</button>
  </view>

  <view wx:else class="empty-upload">
    <view class="empty-upload-title">先添加一张发货单</view>
    <view class="muted">原图会保留下来，后续任何统计都能追溯回这里。</view>
  </view>
</view>
